# Identity plan adoption evidence

This packet records the source and data required for contract 1.0.12; the [completion contract](../../../rust-parity-plan-20261026/COMPLETION-CONTRACT.md) defines its obligations.
The actual generator must produce the plan; expected-plan data serves only as an independent comparison.

Source, execution, publication and main qualification have separate records and decision gates; archived source remains passive.
Native, UI, database, backend restart, capacity, parent acceptance and full SysON parity remain open.
